Race condition appears when we give two or more threads on one operation or method it sometimes perform bad ,so we  use .join() method it takes care when one thread 
completes its execution then second thread start without interuppting them.


  class Counter implements Runnable{

int count;
public void run(){
for(int i=0;i<1000;i++)
{
count++;
}
}
public static void main(String args[]) throws InterruptedException {
        
     Counter c=new Counter();
        Thread t1 =new Thread(c);
         Thread t2 =new Thread(c);
         t1.start();
         t2.start();
         
         t1.join();
         t2.join();
         
         System.out.println(c.count);
        
    }

}

